  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Survive as long as you can and attain immortality.\r\nCollect rocks scattered
    throughout the rooms and bring them back to the glowing magic circle. Depositing
    rocks restores time and increases your total progress.\r\nGreen rocks restore
    a small amount of time.\r\nYellow rocks restore more time.\r\nRed rocks restore
    the most time.\r\nYour timer pauses while you are inside the drop-off circle.\r\nUse
    the stairs to travel between floors. Avoid enemies and projectiles\u2014they
    will knock you back and reduce your remaining time.\r\nDeposit 15 rocks to reach
    the final survival milestone, then keep collecting time until the timer reaches
    120 seconds. If the timer reaches zero, the game is over."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
